      "subject_introduction": "Y\u0101ska's Nirukta (c. 6th\u20135th century BCE) is the oldest surviving Indian treatise on etymology, semantics, and Vedic interpretation, commenting on the Nigha\u1e47\u1e6du lexicon.",
