      "subject_introduction": "\u012a\u015bvarak\u1e5b\u1e63\u1e47a's S\u0101\u1e41khya K\u0101rik\u0101 (72 verses) is the oldest complete surviving text of the S\u0101\u1e41khya philosophical school, mapping reality into 25 evolutionary principles (Tattvas).",
